flowchart TD
    Start["User requests Analyze / Update photo context"]
    Images["Current supported still images + product advertising brief"]
    Hash["Compute image hashes and brief hash"]
    Cache{"Matching image, model, revision and brief?"}
    Reuse["Reuse saved per-photo descriptions"]
    Analyze["Send pending image batches to Gemini"]
    Checkpoint["Checkpoint completed descriptions in photo_analysis.yaml"]
    Combine["Combine current descriptions into overall product context"]
    Save["Save group_summary with per-photo records"]
    Fresh{"Image set and hashes current at script time?"}
    Include["Include observations and summary in product prompt"]
    Omit["Omit stale context; user can refresh"]
    Pick["User selects products and photos for collection"]
    Snapshot["Copy chosen media and snapshot member facts"]
    Subset{"All photos of a member selected?"}
    Full["Capture fresh member visual context"]
    Selected["Capture only fresh observations for selected photos"]
    Member["Store collection_members in collection product.yaml"]
    Story["Shared hook + ordered product scenes + shared CTA"]
    Start --> Images --> Hash --> Cache
    Cache -->|Yes| Reuse --> Combine
    Cache -->|No| Analyze --> Checkpoint --> Combine
    Combine --> Save --> Fresh
    Fresh -->|Yes| Include
    Fresh -->|No| Omit
    Pick --> Snapshot --> Subset
    Save -. cached observations .-> Subset
    Subset -->|Yes| Full --> Member
    Subset -->|No| Selected --> Member
    Member --> Story
